  "description_html": "<section aria-labelledby=\"courseDescription\">\n    ACTS Common Course - ACCT 2013.\n\nPrerequisite: BUAD 2003 or COMS 2003 and a &quot;C&quot; or better in ACCT 2004.\n\nAddresses accounting processes applied to corporations, cash flow statements, and financial statement analysis. Manufacturing cost, managerial reports, and incremental analysis are also introduced. \n\nNote: Accounting majors may not repeat this course to raise grade point in their major field after completing ACCT 3013.\n    \n</section>",
